# Silver Screen Seas - a world plan of the library: Raft's whole story with the library's themed islands
# Raft's eight story islands as Raft has them, and after each one but Utopia a big themed island of the library on its
# own Receiver frequency (after Temperance two: Primeval Park, then Sundown Canyons): the story island's note leads to it
# first, and its quest done gives the next one's frequency. The ten normal-size themed islands turn up as side trips
# while sailing.
#
# Built by the recipe player (CIRecipe plan_silver_screen) in the editor's World plans window. Its play test:
# content\tests\plan_silver_screen.play.
plan new Silver Screen Seas
plan description Raft's whole story with the library's themed islands: after every story island a big island built round a theme the movies love, found on the Receiver - a summer camp, a sunken liner, a jungle pyramid, an arena, a wartime airfield, a marsh of research stations, a park of giant beasts and a frontier town in the canyons. The ten smaller themed islands turn up as side trips while you sail. Its main islands are about as big as Raft's own big islands.
plan random on
plan story on

# --- The story: a big themed island after each of Raft's (done when its quest is) ---------------------------------------
plan rule blackwater | island:Camp Blackwater | start | receiver:700 | Under the Radio Tower's signal a cassette is playing, over and over: a summer camp's song. | Camp Blackwater | after:RadioTower | quest
plan rule liner | island:The Sunken Liner | start | receiver:900 | The Vasagatan's radio finds an old distress call on a loop: a liner, broken on the ice-rocks. | The Sunken Liner | after:Vasagatan | quest
plan rule pyramid | island:The Step Pyramid | start | receiver:900 | Balboa's radio mast catches an explorer's last broadcast from a jungle plateau. | The Step Pyramid | after:Balboa | quest
plan rule arena | island:The Arena | start | receiver:900 | A cheerful voice on the Receiver announces the games - season nineteen, contestants welcome. | The Arena | after:CaravanTown | quest
plan rule airfield | island:Albatross Field | start | receiver:1000 | A tower's call sign, sent by a machine: Albatross Field, runway open, one flight still out. | Albatross Field | after:Tangaroa | quest
plan rule stations | island:The Island of Stations | start | receiver:1000 | Numbers, read out over and over in a calm voice - and a station's call sign between them. | The Island of Stations | after:VarunaPoint | quest
plan rule park | island:Primeval Park | start | receiver:1000 | A park's welcome jingle - and under it, something big bellowing. | Primeval Park | after:Temperance | quest
plan rule sundown | island:Sundown Canyons | start | receiver:1000 | A telegraph key clicks on the Receiver: a frontier town's sheriff, asking for help. | Sundown Canyons | after:park | quest

# --- Side trips: the normal-size themed islands, now and then ahead while sailing ---------------------------------------
plan rule tiki | island:Tiki Lagoon | km:2 | ahead:450 | Thatched roofs and a tiki bar on a sandy key ahead. | Tiki Lagoon
plan rule gilded | island:Gilded Skull Cove | km:4 | ahead:450 | Two jungle peaks ahead, like the brows of a skull. | Gilded Skull Cove
plan rule labyrinth | island:The Drowned Labyrinth | km:7 | ahead:450 | A buoy bobs over a dark hole in a reef ahead. | The Drowned Labyrinth
plan rule keeper | island:Keeper's Light | km:10 | ahead:450 | A lighthouse on a sea stack ahead - its lamp is dark. | Keeper's Light
plan rule embers | island:Embers Isle | km:13 | ahead:450 | Smoke rises from a black volcanic crescent ahead. | Embers Isle
plan rule saferoom | island:The Safe Room | km:16 | ahead:450 | A concrete villa on a red bluff comes up ahead. | The Safe Room
plan rule sunatoll | island:Sun Atoll | km:20 | ahead:450 | A ring of bleached islets ahead - and measuring posts behind wire. | Sun Atoll
plan rule rockpen | island:The Rock Pen | km:24 | ahead:450 | A guard tower stands over a granite rock in the fog ahead. | The Rock Pen
plan rule highmoor | island:Highmoor Lodge | km:28 | ahead:450 | A lodge on a snowy hill ahead, its windows dark. | Highmoor Lodge
plan rule crater | island:Crater Lair | km:32 | ahead:450 | A great dish turns slowly in the crater of a black cone ahead. | Crater Lair
plan ending Roll the credits. Eight great islands, eight stories the movies love - and you sailed through every one of them.\n\nThe end of Silver Screen Seas.
plan save
